<title>USA: Henkel finishes Loctite buy.</title>
<headline>Henkel finishes Loctite buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Henkel KGaA said it completed its acquisition of Loctite Corp on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the merger of its subsidiary Henkel Merger Corp with Loctite took effect, completing the purchase.</p>
<p>Henkel holds 96 percent of Loctite's stock. All remaining Loctite shareholders will get $61 a share in cash when they surrender certificates for their shares.</p>
<p>Loctite is a Hartford, Conn., adhesives and specialty chemicals company.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
</text>
